# Third party image attribution

Each included image retains the license named below. The MIT license at the repository root covers the software and original documentation, not third-party images. Source credits and any stated source restrictions remain applicable. C1 rasterization, preparation, compression and resizing do not change those licenses. Adaptations of share-alike images are distributed under the same listed share-alike license.

Six Our World in Data chart files are withheld because the recorded rights review did not independently clear third-party source terms. Their questions and tested-byte hashes remain in the bank. A current live chart is not a guaranteed replacement for the tested snapshot.

